em_assets/steam/apps/1293460/extras/f00ebc53aa29629a2448eaa4f7894100.webm?t=1738770897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293460/extras/f00ebc53aa29629a2448eaa4f7894100.mp4?t=1738770897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And last but certainly not least, you can join us on Discord for all the latest <i>Ash of Gods</i> updates.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293460/extras/d9f7256131f4cc04613e855f204738b4.poster.avif?t=1738770897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293460/extras/d9f7256131f4cc04613e855f204738b4.webm?t=1738770897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1293460/extras/d9f7256131f4cc04613e855f204738b4.mp4?t=1738770897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
